\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\ln\\left|\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 3\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "814ee171-3b7b-5c89-a9a6-d962d39682cd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "814ee171-3b7b-5c89-a9a6-d962d39682cd" :question/answer-fields "7d01999e-1dff-5fe1-8c7b-16ef684aa1e4"] [:db/ensure "814ee171-3b7b-5c89-a9a6-d962d39682cd" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "814ee171-3b7b-5c89-a9a6-d962d39682cd"] [:db/add "72f9f50c-362f-5924-93b4-efbb715f34c7" :answer/id #uuid "72f9f50c-362f-5924-93b4-efbb715f34c7"] [:db/add "72f9f50c-362f-5924-93b4-efbb715f34c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "72f9f50c-362f-5924-93b4-efbb715f34c7" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "72f9f50c-362f-5924-93b4-efbb715f34c7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c69cb211-7316-57f8-b371-2ddded406322" :answer-field/id #uuid "c69cb211-7316-57f8-b371-2ddded406322"] [:db/add "c69cb211-7316-57f8-b371-2ddded406322" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c69cb211-7316-57f8-b371-2ddded406322" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c69cb211-7316-57f8-b371-2ddded406322" :answer-field/choices "72f9f50c-362f-5924-93b4-efbb715f34c7"] [:db/add "c69cb211-7316-57f8-b371-2ddded406322" :answer-field/correct "72f9f50c-362f-5924-93b4-efbb715f34c7"] [:db/ensure "c69cb211-7316-57f8-b371-2ddded406322" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f3516963-1484-53a1-8a40-034a3bf770c7" :question/id #uuid "f3516963-1484-53a1-8a40-034a3bf770c7"] [:db/add "f3516963-1484-53a1-8a40-034a3bf770c7" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "f3516963-1484-53a1-8a40-034a3bf770c7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f3516963-1484-53a1-8a40-034a3bf770c7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f3516963-1484-53a1-8a40-034a3bf770c7" :question/answer-fields "c69cb211-7316-57f8-b371-2ddded406322"] [:db/ensure "f3516963-1484-53a1-8a40-034a3bf770c7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "f3516963-1484-53a1-8a40-034a3bf770c7"] [:db/add "e9bc5d96-7b33-554b-aa73-01e876b74a5e" :answer/id #uuid "e9bc5d96-7b33-554b-aa73-01e876b74a5e"] [:db/add "e9bc5d96-7b33-554b-aa73-01e876b74a5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e9bc5d96-7b33-554b-aa73-01e876b74a5e" :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "e9bc5d96-7b33-554b-aa73-01e876b74a5e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bad5a9fd-c3ef-5060-98a0-638a358c7fd0" :answer-field/id #uuid "bad5a9fd-c3ef-5060-98a0-638a358c7fd0"] [:db/add "bad5a9fd-c3ef-5060-98a0-638a358c7fd0" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "bad5a9fd-c3ef-5060-98a0-638a358c7fd0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "bad5a9fd-c3ef-5060-98a0-638a358c7fd0" :answer-field/choices "e9bc5d96-7b33-554b-aa73-01e876b74a5e"] [:db/add "bad5a9fd-c3ef-5060-98a0-638a358c7fd0" :answer-field/correct "e9bc5d96-7b33-554b-aa73-01e876b74a5e"] [:db/ensure "bad5a9fd-c3ef-5060-98a0-638a358c7fd0" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a740335f-2313-59f4-baf8-d5ea9f58518f" :question/id #uuid "a740335f-2313-59f4-baf8-d5ea9f58518f"] [:db/add "a740335f-2313-59f4-baf8-d5ea9f58518f" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "a740335f-2313-59f4-baf8-d5ea9f58518f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a740335f-2313-59f4-baf8-d5ea9f58518f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a740335f-2313-59f4-baf8-d5ea9f58518f" :question/answer-fields "bad5a9fd-c3ef-5060-98a0-638a358c7fd0"] [:db/ensure "a740335f-2313-59f4-baf8-d5ea9f58518f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "a740335f-2313-59f4-baf8-d5ea9f58518f"] [:db/add "a9c8a010-4b8a-5907-bc5a-e66a46e14dac" :answer/id #uuid "a9c8a010-4b8a-5907-bc5a-e66a46e14dac"] [:db/add "a9c8a010-4b8a-5907-bc5a-e66a46e14dac" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a9c8a010-4b8a-5907-bc5a-e66a46e14dac" :answer/value "\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 1\\right|"] [:db/ensure "a9c8a010-4b8a-5907-bc5a-e66a46e14dac" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5cbae233-98a3-5c50-860e-bcf4b0fcb550" :answer-field/id #uuid "5cbae233-98a3-5c50-860e-bcf4b0fcb550"] [:db/add "5cbae233-98a3-5c50-860e-bcf4b0fcb550" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "5cbae233-98a3-5c50-860e-bcf4b0fcb550" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5cbae233-98a3-5c50-860e-bcf4b0fcb550" :answer-field/choices "a9c8a010-4b8a-5907-bc5a-e66a46e14dac"] [:db/add "5cbae233-98a3-5c50-860e-bcf4b0fcb550" :answer-field/correct "a9c8a010-4b8a-5907-bc5a-e66a46e14dac"] [:db/ensure "5cbae233-98a3-5c50-860e-bcf4b0fcb550" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b8933d47-56a8-582e-928b-092cd950d138" :question/id #uuid "b8933d47-56a8-582e-928b-092cd950d138"] [:db/add "b8933d47-56a8-582e-928b-092cd950d138" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "b8933d47-56a8-582e-928b-092cd950d138" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 1\\right|+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "b8933d47-56a8-582e-928b-092cd950d138" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b8933d47-56a8-582e-928b-092cd950d138" :question/answer-fields "5cbae233-98a3-5c50-860e-bcf4b0fcb550"] [:db/ensure "b8933d47-56a8-582e-928b-092cd950d138" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "b8933d47-56a8-582e-928b-092cd950d138"] [:db/add "6791639f-e85c-511e-a7a9-b1ce4488a41c" :answer/id #uuid "6791639f-e85c-511e-a7a9-b1ce4488a41c"] [:db/add "6791639f-e85c-511e-a7a9-b1ce4488a41c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6791639f-e85c-511e-a7a9-b1ce4488a41c" :answer/value "3\\left(\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1-\\ln\\left|\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "6791639f-e85c-511e-a7a9-b1ce4488a41c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "89e0ec2d-137a-54be-a50b-ce8f60006201" :answer-field/id #uuid "89e0ec2d-137a-54be-a50b-ce8f60006201"] [:db/add "89e0ec2d-137a-54be-a50b-ce8f60006201" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "89e0ec2d-137a-54be-a50b-ce8f60006201" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "89e0ec2d-137a-54be-a50b-ce8f60006201" :answer-field/choices "6791639f-e85c-511e-a7a9-b1ce4488a41c"] [:db/add "89e0ec2d-137a-54be-a50b-ce8f60006201" :answer-field/correct "6791639f-e85c-511e-a7a9-b1ce4488a41c"] [:db/ensure "89e0ec2d-137a-54be-a50b-ce8f60006201" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b689432e-66ac-5b87-8fa2-bb1b2cf8e8af" :question/id #uuid "b689432e-66ac-5b87-8fa2-bb1b2cf8e8af"] [:db/add "b689432e-66ac-5b87-8fa2-bb1b2cf8e8af" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3 \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "b689432e-66ac-5b87-8fa2-bb1b2cf8e8af" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nSince $\\sec{\\left(x \\right)}=u-1$, rewrite the remaining factor:\n\n$$\n\\frac{u-1}{u}=1-\\frac{1}{u}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3 \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int 1 - \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int 1 - \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(u-\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1-\\ln\\left|\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "b689432e-66ac-5b87-8fa2-bb1b2cf8e8af" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b689432e-66ac-5b87-8fa2-bb1b2cf8e8af" :question/answer-fields "89e0ec2d-137a-54be-a50b-ce8f60006201"] [:db/ensure "b689432e-66ac-5b87-8fa2-bb1b2cf8e8af" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "b689432e-66ac-5b87-8fa2-bb1b2cf8e8af"] [:db/add "d709d9ae-910f-5d5d-a54b-2bde06e4ccb4" :answer/id #uuid "d709d9ae-910f-5d5d-a54b-2bde06e4ccb4"] [:db/add "d709d9ae-910f-5d5d-a54b-2bde06e4ccb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d709d9ae-910f-5d5d-a54b-2bde06e4ccb4" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|\\sin{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 3\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "d709d9ae-910f-5d5d-a54b-2bde06e4ccb4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0cf135d1-697b-5dd2-8a13-56a0fd6da60a" :answer-field/id #uuid "0cf135d1-697b-5dd2-8a13-56a0fd6da60a"] [:db/add "0cf135d1-697b-5dd2-8a13-56a0fd6da60a" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "0cf135d1-697b-5dd2-8a13-56a0fd6da60a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0cf135d1-697b-5dd2-8a13-56a0fd6da60a" :answer-field/choices "d709d9ae-910f-5d5d-a54b-2bde06e4ccb4"] [:db/add "0cf135d1-697b-5dd2-8a13-56a0fd6da60a" :answer-field/correct "d709d9ae-910f-5d5d-a54b-2bde06e4ccb4"] [:db/ensure "0cf135d1-697b-5dd2-8a13-56a0fd6da60a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6a513168-a50a-53a3-ae8a-8609996eaa42" :question/id #uuid "6a513168-a50a-53a3-ae8a-8609996eaa42"] [:db/add "6a513168-a50a-53a3-ae8a-8609996eaa42" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{x \\cos{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}}{\\sin{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "6a513168-a50a-53a3-ae8a-8609996eaa42" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\sin{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 x \\cos{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{x \\cos{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}}{\\sin{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|\\sin{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 3\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "6a513168-a50a-53a3-ae8a-8609996eaa42" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "6a513168-a50a-53a3-ae8a-8609996eaa42" :question/answer-fields "0cf135d1-697b-5dd2-8a13-56a0fd6da60a"] [:db/ensure "6a513168-a50a-53a3-ae8a-8609996eaa42" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "6a513168-a50a-53a3-ae8a-8609996eaa42"] [:db/add "9ff12b9c-f478-55c9-9e94-7dd62e089931" :answer/id #uuid "9ff12b9c-f478-55c9-9e94-7dd62e089931"] [:db/add "9ff12b9c-f478-55c9-9e94-7dd62e089931" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9ff12b9c-f478-55c9-9e94-7dd62e089931" :answer/value "\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 3-3\\left(\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 3\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "9ff12b9c-f478-55c9-9e94-7dd62e089931" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1904af38-2e73-589b-81c8-b92a12979329" :answer-field/id #uuid "1904af38-2e73-589b-81c8-b92a12979329"] [:db/add "1904af38-2e73-589b-81c8-b92a12979329" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "1904af38-2e73-589b-81c8-b92a12979329" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1904af38-2e73-589b-81c8-b92a12979329" :answer-field/choices "9ff12b9c-f478-55c9-9e94-7dd62e089931"] [:db/add "1904af38-2e73-589b-81c8-b92a12979329" :answer-field/correct "9ff12b9c-f478-55c9-9e94-7dd62e089931"] [:db/ensure "1904af38-2e73-589b-81c8-b92a12979329" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5e778c5b-a9a7-5d46-b8a8-f352c7747af0" :question/id #uuid "5e778c5b-a9a7-5d46-b8a8-f352c7747af0"] [:db/add "5e778c5b-a9a7-5d46-b8a8-f352c7747af0" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "5e778c5b-a9a7-5d46-b8a8-f352c7747af0" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nSince $\\tan{\\left(x \\right)}=u-3$, rewrite the remaining factor:\n\n$$\n\\frac{u-3}{u}=1-\\frac{3}{u}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int 1 - \\frac{3}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int 1 - \\frac{3}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=u-3\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 3-3\\left(\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 3\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5e778c5b-a9a7-5d46-b8a8-f352c7747af0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "5e778c5b-a9a7-5d46-b8a8-f352c7747af0" :question/answer-fields "1904af38-2e73-589b-81c8-b92a12979329"] [:db/ensure "5e778c5b-a9a7-5d46-b8a8-f352c7747af0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "5e778c5b-a9a7-5d46-b8a8-f352c7747af0"] [:db/add "5f04584b-f8eb-58cc-9134-f4421a3e4ca8" :answer/id #uuid "5f04584b-f8eb-58cc-9134-f4421a3e4ca8"] [:db/add "5f04584b-f8eb-58cc-9134-f4421a3e4ca8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5f04584b-f8eb-58cc-9134-f4421a3e4ca8" :answer/value "\\ln\\left(2\\right)-\\ln\\left(1\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5f04584b-f8eb-58cc-9134-f4421a3e4ca8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "53731fe6-6317-5d2a-bfa9-b7495dba0082" :answer-field/id #uuid "53731fe6-6317-5d2a-bfa9-b7495dba0082"] [:db/add "53731fe6-6317-5d2a-bfa9-b7495dba0082" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "53731fe6-6317-5d2a-bfa9-b7495dba0082" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "53731fe6-6317-5d2a-bfa9-b7495dba0082" :answer-field/choices "5f04584b-f8eb-58cc-9134-f4421a3e4ca8"] [:db/add "53731fe6-6317-5d2a-bfa9-b7495dba0082" :answer-field/correct "5f04584b-f8eb-58cc-9134-f4421a3e4ca8"] [:db/ensure "53731fe6-6317-5d2a-bfa9-b7495dba0082" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b9b93d2a-b62e-5c23-aeae-afb2a1507e31" :question/id #uuid "b9b93d2a-b62e-5c23-aeae-afb2a1507e31"] [:db/add "b9b93d2a-b62e-5c23-aeae-afb2a1507e31" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "b9b93d2a-b62e-5c23-aeae-afb2a1507e31" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{1}^{2} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\sin{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1$.\n\nBoth transformed bounds are positive. Evaluating gives\n\n$$\n\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{1}^{2}=\\ln\\left(2\\right)-\\ln\\left(1\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\ln\\left(2\\right)-\\ln\\left(1\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "b9b93d2a-b62e-5c23-aeae-afb2a1507e31" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b9b93d2a-b62e-5c23-aeae-afb2a1507e31" :question/answer-fields "53731fe6-6317-5d2a-bfa9-b7495dba0082"] [:db/ensure "b9b93d2a-b62e-5c23-aeae-afb2a1507e31" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "b9b93d2a-b62e-5c23-aeae-afb2a1507e31"] [:db/add "02965d4b-faaa-5096-b5df-447c035ce0bf" :answer/id #uuid "02965d4b-faaa-5096-b5df-447c035ce0bf"] [:db/add "02965d4b-faaa-5096-b5df-447c035ce0bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "02965d4b-faaa-5096-b5df-447c035ce0bf" :answer/value "-\\left(\\ln\\left(2\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "02965d4b-faaa-5096-b5df-447c035ce0bf" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6a088d08-8fcb-5abd-8f52-05f4b1fcd2fc" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a088d08-8fcb-5abd-8f52-05f4b1fcd2fc"] [:db/add "6a088d08-8fcb-5abd-8f52-05f4b1fcd2fc" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "6a088d08-8fcb-5abd-8f52-05f4b1fcd2fc" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "6a088d08-8fcb-5abd-8f52-05f4b1fcd2fc" :answer-field/choices "02965d4b-faaa-5096-b5df-447c035ce0bf"] [:db/add "6a088d08-8fcb-5abd-8f52-05f4b1fcd2fc" :answer-field/correct "02965d4b-faaa-5096-b5df-447c035ce0bf"] [:db/ensure "6a088d08-8fcb-5abd-8f52-05f4b1fcd2fc" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d64bb1a3-1a32-52b0-9826-7134d84df8c8" :question/id #uuid "d64bb1a3-1a32-52b0-9826-7134d84df8c8"] [:db/add "d64bb1a3-1a32-52b0-9826-7134d84df8c8" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\frac{3 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\cos^{3}{\\left(x \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "d64bb1a3-1a32-52b0-9826-7134d84df8c8" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\cos^{3}{\\left(x \\right)} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- 3 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=3\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\frac{3 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\cos^{3}{\\left(x \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int_{3}^{2} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(0 \\right)}=1,\\quad \\cos{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=0$.\n\nBoth transformed bounds are positive. Evaluating gives\n\n$$\n-\\left(\\left[\\ln u\\right]_{3}^{2}\\right)=-\\left(\\ln\\left(2\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n-\\left(\\ln\\left(2\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "d64bb1a3-1a32-52b0-9826-7134d84df8c8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "d64bb1a3-1a32-52b0-9826-7134d84df8c8" :question/answer-fields "6a088d08-8fcb-5abd-8f52-05f4b1fcd2fc"] [:db/ensure "d64bb1a3-1a32-52b0-9826-7134d84df8c8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "d64bb1a3-1a32-52b0-9826-7134d84df8c8"] [:db/add "8267cbb4-4794-526d-8dd7-f3b33e49d99e" :answer/id #uuid "8267cbb4-4794-526d-8dd7-f3b33e49d99e"] [:db/add "8267cbb4-4794-526d-8dd7-f3b33e49d99e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8267cbb4-4794-526d-8dd7-f3b33e49d99e" :answer/value "\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 2\\right|"] [:db/ensure "8267cbb4-4794-526d-8dd7-f3b33e49d99e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "223445a6-579b-5a5a-8a8b-8a5fb2dafc16" :answer-field/id #uuid "223445a6-579b-5a5a-8a8b-8a5fb2dafc16"] [:db/add "223445a6-579b-5a5a-8a8b-8a5fb2dafc16" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "223445a6-579b-5a5a-8a8b-8a5fb2dafc16" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "223445a6-579b-5a5a-8a8b-8a5fb2dafc16" :answer-field/choices "8267cbb4-4794-526d-8dd7-f3b33e49d99e"] [:db/add "223445a6-579b-5a5a-8a8b-8a5fb2dafc16" :answer-field/correct "8267cbb4-4794-526d-8dd7-f3b33e49d99e"] [:db/ensure "223445a6-579b-5a5a-8a8b-8a5fb2dafc16" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e171619c-4f71-5b4c-bd69-f4c66fa2cf10" :question/id #uuid "e171619c-4f71-5b4c-bd69-f4c66fa2cf10"] [:db/add "e171619c-4f71-5b4c-bd69-f4c66fa2cf10" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "e171619c-4f71-5b4c-bd69-f4c66fa2cf10" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}}{\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\ln\\left|\\tan{\\left(x^{2} \\right)} + 2\\right|+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e171619c-4f71-5b4c-bd69-f4c66fa2cf10" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e171619c-4f71-5b4c-bd69-f4c66fa2cf10" :question/answer-fields "223445a6-579b-5a5a-8a8b-8a5fb2dafc16"] [:db/ensure "e171619c-4f71-5b4c-bd69-f4c66fa2cf10" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "e171619c-4f71-5b4c-bd69-f4c66fa2cf10"] [:db/add "6bbdf42f-87ed-59bf-b476-8d6b3a225209" :answer/id #uuid "6bbdf42f-87ed-59bf-b476-8d6b3a225209"] [:db/add "6bbdf42f-87ed-59bf-b476-8d6b3a225209" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6bbdf42f-87ed-59bf-b476-8d6b3a225209" :answer/value "\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 3-3\\left(\\ln\\left|\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 3\\right|\\right)"] [:db/ensure "6bbdf42f-87ed-59bf-b476-8d6b3a225209" :answer/validate] [:db/add "86fc8906-b718-5538-ab4c-59b274460a6d" :answer-field/id #uuid "86fc8906-b718-5538-ab4c-59b274460a6d"] [:db/add "86fc8906-b718-5538-ab4c-59b274460a6d" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "86fc8906-b718-5538-ab4c-59b274460a6d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "86fc8906-b718-5538-ab4c-59b274460a6d" :answer-field/choices "6bbdf42f-87ed-59bf-b476-8d6b3a225209"] [:db/add "86fc8906-b718-5538-ab4c-59b274460a6d" :answer-field/correct "6bbdf42f-87ed-59bf-b476-8d6b3a225209"] [:db/ensure "86fc8906-b718-5538-ab4c-59b274460a6d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4754b829-a388-5af4-91ff-05af3534885f" :question/id #uuid "4754b829-a388-5af4-91ff-05af3534885f"] [:db/add "4754b829-a388-5af4-91ff-05af3534885f" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "4754b829-a388-5af4-91ff-05af3534885f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nSince $\\sec{\\left(x \\right)}=u-3$, rewrite the remaining factor:\n\n$$\n\\frac{u-3}{u}=1-\\frac{3}{u}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int 1 - \\frac{3}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int 1 - \\frac{3}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=u-3\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 3-3\\left(\\ln\\left|\\sec{\\left(x \\right)} + 3\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "4754b829-a388-5af4-91ff-05af3534885f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "4754b829-a388-5af4-91ff-05af3534885f" :question/answer-fields "86fc8906-b718-5538-ab4c-59b274460a6d"] [:db/ensure "4754b